Apple today provided the first beta of an upcoming <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macos-26/">macOS Tahoe</a> 26.4 update to developers for testing purposes, with the update coming just a few days after Apple launched &zwnj;macOS Tahoe&zwnj; 26.3. <br/>
